/P 287 0 R
/E (This chapter introduces autism spectrum disorder and describes its key behavioral characteristics. It focuses on common movement patterns and behaviors relevant to autism detection, providing the conceptual foundation for the proposed system.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
