/P 305 0 R
/T (The qualitative results show that the model performs well in clear and well-lit scenarios, where movements are more distinguishable. However, detection accuracy decreases in cases involving subtle motions, partial occlusions, or low-quality video frames. These observations are consistent with the expected limitations of frame-based object detection models.)
/E (The qualitative results show that the model performs well in clear and well-lit scenarios, where movements are more distinguishable. However, detection accuracy decreases in cases involving subtle motions, partial occlusions, or low-quality video frames. These observations are consistent with the expected limitations of frame-based object detection models.)
